==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]] and [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*4 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Most strategies from [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The Wormhole Opens]] will no longer work, but this stage is still a joke with all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] due to the weak base stats of the enemies, meaning that getting said [[Treasure]]s is highly recommended.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] - Can help chip down both the [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and peons with his Strong Against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] ability, which allows him to deal high damage when stacked.
*[[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs Cat]]/[[Talents|Talented]] [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Loincloth Cat]] - Both are good choices for breaking the General GreGories' [[Barrier]]s. Li'l Macho Legs Cat is also recommended for his ability to knockback Aliens.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] - He completely shreds the stage with his [[Explosion]] Talent, but even without Talents, you can still use him along with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie]] to let him deal high damage to the Cyclone and peons.

